                      "skillcd&cost": "",
                      "skilldesc": "<font color=\"a6aafb\">Bear's Blessing</font>: Masha has 3 HP bars, each inheriting 50% of her Equipment HP bonuses. When an HP bar is depleted, she removes control effects and blocks damage once. She gains <font color=\"a6aafb\">Feral</font> by dealing damage to enemy heroes or creeps. <font color=\"a6aafb\">Feral</font> converts into HP after leaving combat.\n<font color=\"a6aafb\">Power of Wildness</font>: After Masha's skills deal damage to an enemy hero, she leaves a <font color=\"a6aafb\">Wound</font> in a random direction. Her Basic Attacks can break the <font color=\"a6aafb\">Wound</font> and cause her to enter the <font color=\"a6aafb\">Feral</font> state.\n<font color=\"a6aafb\">Feral</font>: Masha gains 15<font color=\"ffe63c\"> (+1*Hero Level)</font>% Resilience, Attack Speed, and Movement Speed. Her next 3 Basic Attacks become fan-shaped claw strikes, dealing 3<font color=\"fba51f\"> (+2% Extra Physical Attack)</font> <font color=\"ffe63c\">(+0.2*Hero Level)</font>% <font color=\"26e407\"><1005></font> extra <font color=\"fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</font> to enemies in the area (extra damage does not apply to Turrets) and recovering 4<font color=\"ffe63c\"> (+0.4*Hero Level)</font>% HP. It lasts 3s.\n[C8Breaking a <font color=\"a6aafb\">Wound</font> again during the <font color=\"a6aafb\">Feral</font> state will refresh its duration. Up to 6 claw strikes can be stored.]",
